{"c":[{"id":"fb9536a9c704d4b7","sum":"Repo and v1 lore: SumMem at .summem/summem; .scratch/ never committed; v1 kept five upstreams, Screenpipe a supervised sidecar (launcher lease) behind a last-N facade that hard-fails when down or empty; Supabase is control plane only; never commit SUPABASE_HACKATHON_TOKEN.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"5e2a432b193b2a33","sum":"Repo setup and v1 lore: SumMem at .summem/summem; .scratch/ never committed; v1 kept five upstreams with Screenpipe as a sidecar plus last-N facade.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"13a625ab21eb3fe9","sum":"SumMem 0.12.0 lives at .summem/summem (AGENTS.md Project Memory block is the write rule); .scratch/ is gitignored local scratch, never committed.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T170845Z-b7aad83361017857","text":"Onboarded SumMem 0.12.0 as .summem/summem (not a packages/ pin); AGENTS.md Project Memory block is the write rule.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T172705Z-bea3983b0d18183c","text":".scratch/ is gitignored local scratch (exports, dumps); do not commit it","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"ab8c7585980a9874","sum":"v1 Caret keeps five upstreams (KeyType, GhostType, Computer Use Jev, Skyvern, Screenpipe); Screenpipe history is a sidecar plus last-N facade, never vendored, no TCC inherited from its CLI.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T173934Z-80f0ac884170d4c1","text":"Caret keeps five upstreams: KeyType, GhostType, Computer Use Jev, Skyvern and Screenpipe. docs/input-pipeline.md defines the proposed shared Jev/context/workflow handoff; the current action UI does not call the Python CLI.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T174647Z-c6a318f44bd68335","text":"Screenpipe history for Caret is sidecar plus facade (last N minutes/windows); do not vendor current engine or inherit TCC from their CLI","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"05674c45506c1bae","sum":"v1 Screenpipe and secrets: last-N inference hard-fails when the sidecar is down or empty; Caret supervises pinned Screenpipe via a launcher lease; Supabase is control plane only; never commit SUPABASE_HACKATHON_TOKEN.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"a7b8b39bcec29186","sum":"v1: inference needing Screenpipe last-N hard-fails when the sidecar is down or empty; CI has secret SUPABASE_HACKATHON_TOKEN, never commit its value.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T174733Z-8bbd21a4d3d18747","text":"Caret inference that needs Screenpipe history hard-fails if the sidecar is down or last-N is empty; do not continue on a miss","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T175112Z-813e2fb0e5f124b2","text":"GitHub Actions repo secret SUPABASE_HACKATHON_TOKEN is available for CI; do not commit the value.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"0988f580d7d5ff22","sum":"v1: Caret launches and supervises pinned Screenpipe (TCC stays on its binary; client uses the launcher lease); Supabase only as control plane, never for last-N or threads.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T175326Z-cc8628073d6c6682","text":"Override: Caret launches and supervises pinned Screenpipe; do not spawn revoked; TCC still on their binary; client uses launcher lease","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T175517Z-d3f766ae6d1e35f4","text":"Supabase earns a seat only as company control plane (identity, entitlements, kill-switch, structured facts); skill bodies stay git/Cursor plugins; never upload last-N or threads.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"43ee91e8384e1ba6","sum":"Mac CI: keep macos-26/Xcode 26 in ci.yml (macos-15 type-checks #available); #if-gate new SDK APIs. Caret.app runs its own screenpipe@0.4.50 on :3031, never attaching; clipboard needs --disable-clipboard-capture false; lease in .local/. No CaretProjectRoot key: supervisor no-ops.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"fec1309988e3870c","sum":"Mac CI runs macos-26 (Xcode 26, glassEffect): keep the Xcode 26 select in ci.yml, not macos-15 (Xcode 16.4, where #available still type-checks); #if compiler-gate new SDK APIs. Screenpipe 0.4.50 keeps no clipboard history unless --disable-clipboard-capture false.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"54b806582777cca4","sum":"2026-09-19 hackathon was happy-path only (ship, do not polish, preflight must not block on niceties). Mac CI: macos-15 defaults to Xcode 16.4 and #available still type-checks, so keep the Xcode 26 select in ci.yml and #if compiler-gate new SDK APIs.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T175827Z-8c1a94d022e0b4f9","text":"2026-09-19 hackathon: GSD and happy-path only; ship, do not polish; preflight must not block on niceties","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T180736Z-4ff972dc89772e30","text":"Mac CI (macos-15) defaults to Xcode 16.4; #available is runtime-only and still type-checks. Keep the Xcode 26 select in ci.yml and #if compiler-gate new SDK APIs.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"3a7837f8430ada51","sum":"Mac CI on main runs macos-26 for glassEffect/Xcode 26; do not move it back to macos-15 (Xcode 16.4). Screenpipe 0.4.50 keeps no clipboard history unless --disable-clipboard-capture false; Caret's pinned launch does not pass it.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T180843Z-c0da2dfb3d09eb5e","text":"Mac CI on main is macos-26 for glassEffect/Xcode 26. Do not move that job back to macos-15 default Xcode 16.4.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T181107Z-8c8e5b028a0a7d1d","text":"Screenpipe 0.4.50 stores no clipboard history by default; enable with --disable-clipboard-capture false. Caret pin launch does not pass that flag.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"82995c451c95a78f","sum":"Caret.app runs its own screenpipe@0.4.50 on :3031 (never attaches; a second recorder can stop the first); clipboard needs --disable-clipboard-capture false; last-N via .local/screenpipe-lease.json. No INFOPLIST_KEY_CaretProjectRoot: ScreenpipeSupervisor.start no-ops.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"aa7dada86df3ecf0","sum":"Caret last-N reads minutes/windows/clipboard, newest first, via a lease in .local/screenpipe-lease.json. Caret.app launches screenpipe@0.4.50 on :3031 with clipboard on; clipboard is a Screenpipe UiEventType input, off unless --disable-clipboard-capture false.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T181331Z-7829432da9c4fa32","text":"On main 3db8f16 Caret last-N is minutes/windows via a lease; Caret.app does not spawn Screenpipe. Clipboard is a Screenpipe input UiEventType, off unless --disable-clipboard-capture false.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T182537Z-ff4a55f19dd31fc9","text":"Caret.app launches screenpipe@0.4.50 on 3031 with clipboard on and writes .local/screenpipe-lease.json. history-windows/minutes/clipboard are newest-first.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"7effd9669f8097f6","sum":"Caret.app starts its own screenpipe@0.4.50 on :3031, never attaching to a manual or launchd one (a second recorder can stop the first). INFOPLIST_KEY_CaretProjectRoot is missing from generated Info.plist, so ScreenpipeSupervisor.start is a no-op until it is added.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T183142Z-62bc24835e4cc470","text":"Caret.app always starts its own screenpipe@0.4.50 on :3031 and does not attach to a manual or launchd instance; a second recorder can stop the first.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T183914Z-5f4c9ce43ef55285","text":"INFOPLIST_KEY_CaretProjectRoot does not land in GENERATE_INFOPLIST_FILE output, so shipped Caret.app has no project root and ScreenpipeSupervisor.start is a no-op until that key is actually in Info.plist.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
